// Question bank for Books, the daily books gauntlet. Imported ONLY by the
// server page (app/books/page.js), which resolves the picked day's twenty-five
// questions and hands the client just that day, so the rest of the bank never
// reaches a browser. GENERATED by scripts/gen-books.mjs from scripts/books-lanes/.
//
//   id       'd<day>q<slot>' - authored day and play order (slot 1..25)
//   cat      one of five lanes; each tier block covers all five, always in the
//            same order: Classics, Modern Fiction, Children's & YA, Authors, Poetry & Plays
//   tier     1 (gimme) .. 5 (expert); a day ramps 5 questions per tier
//   choices  exactly four, one defensibly correct; the correct position came
//            from a per-day balanced no-3-run sequence at build time, so do NOT
//            hand-reorder choices here
//
// EVERY FACT IS FROZEN.
// Books keep moving too: a prize is awarded, a sales record falls, a sequel appears. So the bank asks only
// about settled things: who wrote what and when, what happens in it, and prizes won in completed years.
// Nothing later than the 2024 calendar year.
//
// Extending the bank: author new days in the lane files, run
// scripts/gen-books.mjs (it appends, never rewrites), then
// scripts/verify-books.mjs. Never reuse an id or a question, and never let one
// day carry the same answer twice.
